sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Teams User
    participant Bot as Teams Bot
    participant State as State Manager
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant AI as OpenAI API
    participant Tools as Azure DevOps Tools
    participant ADO as Azure DevOps

    User->>Bot: "Show me CR12345"
    Bot->>State: Save conversation reference
    State->>DB: Store user reference
    
    Bot->>AI: Process query with context
    AI->>AI: Analyze intent
    AI->>AI: Select function: get_change_request
    AI-->>Bot: Function call: get_change_request(CR12345)
    
    Bot->>Tools: Execute get_change_request(CR12345)
    
    alt Check database first
        Tools->>DB: Query CR from local DB
        alt CR found in DB
            DB-->>Tools: CR data (fast!)
        else CR not in DB
            Tools->>ADO: Fetch from API
            ADO-->>Tools: CR data
            Tools->>DB: Cache in DB
        end
    end
    
    Tools-->>Bot: CR details
    Bot->>AI: Format response
    AI-->>Bot: Formatted message
    Bot->>User: 📋 CR Details:<br/>Title: ...<br/>State: ...<br/>Owner: ...
